  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of the Slovak Republic Contribution to Afghanistan Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is responding to emergency needs that arise in Afghanistan but are not covered under other funds. This includes, for example, hot meals for flood affected families in Herat. The funds are also being used to strengthen independent monitoring and feedback channels through AWAAZ, the UN-wide call centre and complaints mechanism, and for strengthening key emergency and support positions in the mission.</narrative>
  </description>
